 ### UI (Common)
 
-- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5513+) **Optionally** support **upscaling font size (i.e. font size)** regardless of game resolution. This affects **main interface** (city screen, map view, `city_billboard`/`CITYBILLBOARD`), **advisors**, **sevopedia**, and other places where font size could be changed. Made some **UI adjustments when needed to accomodate the larger text** (e.g., smaller sevopedia leaders item row (else AI Personality Panel's upscaled text overfills), **overwrite city `billboard` xml** in [CIV4DetailManager.xml](/Assets/XML/Misc/CIV4DetailManager.xml) **at runtime** via [SASBillboardScale.py](/Assets/Python/SASBillboardScale.py) (**tunable per font size**), increase **GP bar size** and reduce **tech bar size** in **main interface (common)**). Upscaling text can be **useful for high resolution displays** (where text appears very small), but may **also improve readability at smaller resolutions** (like 1920*1080 or lower). See [GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml](/Assets/XML/GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml) and related places for the change.
+- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5513+) **Optionally** support **upscaling font size (i.e. font size)** regardless of game resolution. This affects **main interface** (city screen, map view, `city_billboard`/`CITYBILLBOARD`), **advisors**, **sevopedia**, and other places where font size could be changed. Made some **UI adjustments when needed to accomodate the larger text** (e.g., smaller sevopedia leaders item row (else AI Personality Panel's upscaled text overfills), **overwrite city `billboard` xml** in [CIV4DetailManager.xml](/Assets/XML/Misc/CIV4DetailManager.xml) **at runtime** via [SASBillboardScale.py](/Assets/Python/SASBillboardScale.py) (**tunable per font size**) (note: **increased font2 billboard from 100 to 120** percent so it is more readable), increase **GP bar size** and reduce **tech bar size** in **main interface (common)**). Upscaling text can be **useful for high resolution displays** (where text appears very small), but may **also improve readability at smaller resolutions** (like 1920*1080 or lower). See [GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml](/Assets/XML/GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml) and related places for the change.
+- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5527+) **Increase hover text** base size from **2 to 3** so it is **more readable**.
 - Added **Emojis** without having to tediously implement them as characters. See [Emojis](/README.md#emojis) and [CIV4ArtDefines_Interface.xml](/Assets/XML/Art/CIV4ArtDefines_Interface.xml).
 - Added **"Cannot be traded"** and **"Can be researched multiple times"** tooltips to the Tech Advisor screen and in Sevopedia. See [README.md (Untradeable techs (bTrade) display)](/README.md#untradeable-techs-btrade-display-information) for details.
 - removed the **Strategy Text** in Choose Production and Choose Research ("Sid’s tips") popups, as well as in the Civic Revolution popup ("Would you like to start a revolution?"), and in Sevopedia; these blurbs were often outdated or tedious to maintain.

